sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as Kubernetes API
    participant Op as VM operator
    participant Store as Storage service
    participant Kube as Scheduler / kubelet
    participant Mgr as VM manager
    participant Netd as Node netd
    participant Q as QEMU
    User->>API: Create VirtualMachine
    API-->>Op: Watch notification
    Op->>API: Reread / validate / establish ownership
    opt Provisioned disks
        Op->>Store: Create or clone / export with fresh generation
        Store-->>Op: Exact disk binding
    end
    Op->>API: Render config + gated VM Pod / record owner UID
    Op->>API: Open scheduling gate when safe
    API->>Kube: Admit and place Pod
    Kube->>Mgr: Start manager container
    Mgr->>Mgr: Acquire state lease / prepare identity and sockets
    opt Guest NICs
        Op->>API: Create co-located NIC anchors / scoped route intent
        Netd->>Netd: Plumb authorized anchor namespaces
        Mgr->>Netd: Request own TAP/vhost descriptors
        Netd-->>Mgr: SCM_RIGHTS FD grant
    end
    Mgr->>Q: Spawn child with private QMP and granted descriptors
    Q-->>Mgr: QMP greeting / events
    Mgr-->>Kube: Local probe results
    Kube-->>API: Pod status
    Op->>API: VM status from current observations
